gametitle=Guilty Gear XX Accent Core Plus (NTSC-U) [SLUS-21847] (F233A433)
comment=Scoped S2 creator features. Read catalog evidence and dependencies before enabling.
comment=Reboot to unload code patches and restore camera state.

[Creator: Camera engine (needed by the camera codes)]
author=retro-graphics-research
description=Installs three small routines in the body of the dead debug routine DebugAllOpen and hooks the camera: zoom multiplier and lock in scaleset, pan and lock in scrxyset, and a camera update on frozen frames in GameMain. With all its variables at 0 it changes nothing.
